{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026l3pybGgKeD1794390743.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地早前加強徵收離岸信託收益稅，據報有關的申報稅款累計逾1,600億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>《新華社》報道，從國家稅務總局獲悉，申報最後期限已經平穩結束，絕大多數納稅人積極配合，收到累計申報稅項逾1,600億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>單計10月份入庫逾1,200億元人民幣，帶動全國期內個人所得稅收入增長近九成。</p><p></p><p>財政部、稅務總局在7月發布公告，規定取得離岸信託收益的納稅人，在90天過渡期內完成申報繳稅，便不會加收滯納金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:17:48.834711+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T09:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T05:37:12.926263+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T12:11:13.197808+00:00","content_hash":"37a8438bdf258d53fbe4b6c55d069d1d8055fec35bdfb1e77d9f940c55b4dd21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T12:17:48.834711+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}